    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Will You Wheel?&quot; is a game where you can buy junk cars and build them for races using tuning parts like turbos, air filters, or exhaust components. It's a life simulator that includes racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your broken car to start the game. Earn money through odd jobs and upgrade your car by ordering parts. You can lower it stance it put a rally suspension or restore it to factory condition. Use a truck to get parts and tow your project car from the junkyard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Will You Wheel?&quot; is a game where you can buy junk cars and build them for races using tuning parts like turbos, air filters, or exhaust components. It's a life simulator that includes racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix your broken car to start the game. Earn money through odd jobs and upgrade your car by ordering parts. You can lower it stance it put a rally suspension or restore it to factory condition. Use a truck to get parts and tow your project car from the junkyard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You inherit your dad\u2019s beaten up car and rebuild it piece by piece, swapping engine parts, upgrading the suspension, fitting new wheels and more until it becomes a high performance race car. Beat your opponents and earn revenge for your dad.",
